    "events_note": "utc = UTC ISO-8601 (source of truth); display = America/Los_Angeles. Sourced from Circle Events (community stucknotbroken, 'Calendar' space id 2429616). events.<series>.upcoming is a FORWARD-LOOKING LIST: the page picks the first entry still in the future AT PAGE LOAD, so the displayed date stays correct between refreshes and a late or failed refresh cannot strand a date that has already passed. next_utc/next_display are the head of that list, kept for older embeds that read them directly. Refresh before the list runs out (see prices_note for the cadence).",
    "prices_note": "Academy moved to monthly billing 2026-08-27: Self-Regulator $24/mo, Co-Regulator $39/mo, cancel anytime. The old term keys (3mo/6mo/12mo) are gone - existing members keep legacy rates, but nothing new is sold on them. Lifetime is still sold but is deliberately NOT advertised. Prices are hand-managed; the scheduled refresh must never rewrite this block."
